      "rich_text": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "plain_text": "It is a natural shelf for anyone who lives with prints. A botanical pattern on the wall and a hand-thrown bowl on the table are closer relations than they look, both built on the same Nordic instinct for pared-back form and honest material. Here are five books we keep coming back to, each real, in print or findable second-hand, and each worth the space.",
